  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening teaching in the G5 Sahel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this project is to fulfil the right to education and ensure the improvement of learning outcomes for children. To achieve this goal, the project will work on improving teacher qualifications, teacher policy and teacher management through a set of targeted interventions. These interventions will seek also to improve the gender balance in the teaching profession.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
